+两个工作流加载相同的文件。两个模板默认都使用 int8 版本的扩散模型。
+
+**text_encoders**
+
+- [qwen3vl_8b_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/blob/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_8b_bf16.safetensors)
+
+**diffusion_models**
+
+- [qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/blob/main/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors)（模板默认加载，内存占用更低）
+- [qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/blob/main/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors)（完整精度，需要更多内存）
+
+**vae**
+
+- [qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/blob/main/vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors)
